	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type `simmer` to see whether this Mac is being held awake and act on it.

  simmer            state plus the actions that fit it
  simmer 90m        stay awake for ninety minutes
  simmer 23:00      stay awake until a wall-clock time
  simmer +15m       extend a running lease

The workflow only shims out to the repo, so editing the scripts there needs
no re-import. Set SIMMER_HOME if the repo is not at ~/workspace/tools/simmer.

Needs the Alfred Powerpack. Without it, use the Raycast script commands
in integrations/raycast/ or the SwiftBar plugin instead.
</string>
